            "sanskrit": "Paśyanti",
            "english": "Perceived",
            "seat": "Heart"
          },
          {
            "sanskrit": "Madhyamā",
            "english": "Medium",
            "seat": "Throat"
          },
          {
            "sanskrit": "Vaikharī",
            "english": "Language",
            "seat": "Mouth, tongue, lips, nasal"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "heading": "Sound perfection: step one",
        "iast": "oṃ yad-akṣara¹ pada² bhraṣṭaṃ mātrā³hīnantu yadbhavet | tat sarvaṃ kṣamyatān deva nārāyaṇa namostute ||",
        "notes": [
